  "What is Skill Registry?": "Skill Registry l\u00e0 g\u00ec?",
  "Skill Registry is a versioned, immutable catalog for skills imported from approved sources.": "Skill Registry l\u00e0 danh m\u1ee5c b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn, c\u00f3 phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n cho c\u00e1c skill nh\u1eadp t\u1eeb ngu\u1ed3n \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c ph\u00ea duy\u1ec7t.",
  "How the workflow works": "Quy tr\u00ecnh ho\u1ea1t \u0111\u1ed9ng",
  "A source is connected to Git Manager or Skill Hub. Sync discovers SKILL.md files and creates candidates. A ready candidate can be published as an immutable version, then downloaded through the public catalog API.": "Ngu\u1ed3n k\u1ebft n\u1ed1i v\u1edbi Git Manager ho\u1eb7c Skill Hub. Sync t\u00ecm SKILL.md v\u00e0 t\u1ea1o candidate. Candidate ready c\u00f3 th\u1ec3 publish th\u00e0nh phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n b\u1ea5t bi\u1ebfn, sau \u0111\u00f3 t\u1ea3i qua API catalog.",
  "Source": "Ngu\u1ed3n", "Candidate": "Candidate", "Catalog API": "API catalog",
  "Instruction-only": "Ch\u1ec9 c\u00f3 h\u01b0\u1edbng d\u1eabn",
  "Only SKILL.md is packaged; files such as references, models, and binaries are not scanned unless codeFile is declared.": "Ch\u1ec9 SKILL.md \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c \u0111\u00f3ng g\u00f3i; references, model v\u00e0 binary kh\u00f4ng b\u1ecb qu\u00e9t tr\u1eeb khi khai b\u00e1o codeFile.",
  "Executable": "C\u00f3 th\u1ec3 th\u1ef1c thi",
  "A declared Python or Node entrypoint is validated and included in the artifact.": "Entrypoint Python ho\u1eb7c Node \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c x\u00e1c th\u1ef1c v\u00e0 \u0111\u01b0a v\u00e0o artifact.",
  "Public catalog API": "API catalog c\u00f4ng khai",
  "Enable anonymous access with SKILL_REGISTRY_PUBLIC_ENABLED=true. These endpoints are read-only and do not require an Authorization header.": "B\u1eadt truy c\u1eadp \u1ea9n danh b\u1eb1ng SKILL_REGISTRY_PUBLIC_ENABLED=true. C\u00e1c endpoint ch\u1ec9 \u0111\u1ecdc v\u00e0 kh\u00f4ng c\u1ea7n header Authorization.",
  "List packages": "Li\u1ec7t k\u00ea package", "Search packages": "T\u00ecm package", "Get package": "L\u1ea5y package", "List versions": "Li\u1ec7t k\u00ea phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n", "Download artifact": "T\u1ea3i artifact", "Registry metadata": "Metadata registry",
  "Copy": "Sao ch\u00e9p", "Copied": "\u0110\u00e3 sao ch\u00e9p",
  "API response and pagination": "Response v\u00e0 ph\u00e2n trang API",
  "list and versions return records in data plus meta.nextCursor. Send the opaque cursor unchanged with the same filters to fetch the next page. limit accepts 1 through 100 and defaults to 20.": "list v\u00e0 versions tr\u1ea3 danh s\u00e1ch trong data c\u00f9ng meta.nextCursor. G\u1eedi nguy\u00ean cursor v\u1edbi c\u00f9ng filter \u0111\u1ec3 l\u1ea5y trang ti\u1ebfp theo. limit t\u1eeb 1 \u0111\u1ebfn 100, m\u1eb7c \u0111\u1ecbnh 20.",
  "download returns a ZIP and the X-Skill-Version, X-Artifact-Sha256, and Digest headers. Hash the downloaded bytes and compare the SHA-256 digest before installing.": "download tr\u1ea3 v\u1ec1 ZIP c\u00f9ng c\u00e1c header X-Skill-Version, X-Artifact-Sha256 v\u00e0 Digest. H\u00e3y ki\u1ec3m tra SHA-256 tr\u01b0\u1edbc khi c\u00e0i \u0111\u1eb7t.",
  "Administration checklist": "Danh s\u00e1ch ki\u1ec3m tra qu\u1ea3n tr\u1ecb",
  "Grant registryExportEnabled on the Git Manager repository, create a source, run Discover or Sync, resolve blocked candidates, and publish a semantic version. A successful sync does not publish a version automatically.": "B\u1eadt registryExportEnabled tr\u00ean repository Git Manager, t\u1ea1o source, ch\u1ea1y Discover ho\u1eb7c Sync, x\u1eed l\u00fd candidate b\u1ecb ch\u1eb7n v\u00e0 publish phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n semver. Sync th\u00e0nh c\u00f4ng kh\u00f4ng t\u1ef1 publish.",
  "Versions stays empty until a candidate is published. A yanked version is no longer downloadable.": "Versions s\u1ebd tr\u1ed1ng cho \u0111\u1ebfn khi candidate \u0111\u01b0\u1ee3c publish. Phi\u00ean b\u1ea3n \u0111\u00e3 yank kh\u00f4ng th\u1ec3 t\u1ea3i.",
